---
source: crates/rumps-query/tests/scripts.rs
description: "; Test: unary operators\n; Tests negation and logical NOT\n\n; === Numeric Negation ===\n\n; Negate integer\nWRITE -5\n; Expected: -5\n\nWRITE -0\n; Expected: 0\n\nWRITE -(-5)\n; Expected: 5\n\n; Negate float\nWRITE -3.14\n; Expected: -3.14\n\nWRITE -0.0\n; Expected: -0.0 (or 0.0)\n\nWRITE -(-2.5)\n; Expected: 2.5\n\n; Negate variable\nLET x = 42\nWRITE -x\n; Expected: -42\n\nLET y = -10\nWRITE -y\n; Expected: 10\n\n; Negate expression\nWRITE -(5 + 3)\n; Expected: -8\n\nWRITE -(10 - 15)\n; Expected: 5\n\n; Negate in larger expression\nWRITE 10 + -3\n; Expected: 7\n\nWRITE 10 - -5\n; Expected: 15\n\nWRITE -5 * 2\n; Expected: -10\n\nWRITE -5 * -2\n; Expected: 10\n\n; === Logical NOT ===\n\nWRITE NOT TRUE\n; Expected: FALSE\n\nWRITE NOT FALSE\n; Expected: TRUE\n\nWRITE !TRUE\n; Expected: FALSE\n\nWRITE !FALSE\n; Expected: TRUE\n\n; NOT with variable\nLET flag = TRUE\nWRITE NOT flag\n; Expected: FALSE\n\nWRITE !flag\n; Expected: FALSE\n\n; Double NOT\nWRITE NOT NOT TRUE\n; Expected: TRUE\n\nWRITE !!FALSE\n; Expected: FALSE\n\n; NOT in expression\nWRITE NOT (5 > 10)\n; Expected: TRUE\n\nWRITE !(3 == 4)\n; Expected: TRUE\n\n; NOT with AND/OR\nWRITE NOT TRUE AND FALSE\n; Expected: FALSE (NOT binds tighter: (NOT TRUE) AND FALSE = FALSE AND FALSE)\n\nWRITE NOT (TRUE AND FALSE)\n; Expected: TRUE (NOT applied to result: NOT FALSE = TRUE)\n\nWRITE NOT FALSE OR TRUE\n; Expected: TRUE ((NOT FALSE) OR TRUE = TRUE OR TRUE)\n\nWRITE \"Unary ops test complete\"\n"
